    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=mJbwhj3beOIB3Jgj]], any creature (other than a [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}) that starts its turn in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=mJbwhj3beOIB3Jgj]]-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}.</p><p><em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the start of its next turn.</p><p><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to the Stench of all [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} for 1 hour.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: A creature (other than one of this name) starting its turn in the emanation makes the save; a success makes it immune to every Stench of this creature kind for 1 hour.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
